---
source: crates/wows-query/tests/game_data.rs
assertion_line: 1396
expression: output
---
group: tier 10 battleships
ranked: 43
formula: "factor share = share of the other ships of the group (of the same tier for bb_ap_citadel, cruiser_he_damaging and bow_overmatch) whose value the ship's beats, ties counting half. A ship without a factor others have (no radar, no torpedoes, no Repair Party) counts as worse than every ship with it and tied with the others without it. A family (gun_dpm, gun_alpha, flight_time) takes the ship's best ammo, ranked among the ships with that ammo. component = weighted mean of its factor shares. score = weighted mean of the components with the class weights below, 0 to 100. An armor value a ship lacks (no citadel plates or armor model) leaves the ship scored on its other factors."
weights:
  - "firepower 30%: gun_dpm (best of dpm_ap, dpm_he, dpm_sap) x1, gun_alpha (best of alpha_ap, alpha_he, alpha_sap) x0.75, fires_per_minute x0.15"
  - "accuracy 10%: dispersion x1, sigma x1, flight_time (best of flight_time_ap, flight_time_he, flight_time_sap) x1"
  - "reach 10%: main_battery_range x1"
  - "survivability 35%: health x1, repair_party_total_heal x1, damage_control_reload x0.25, bb_ap_citadel x0.75, bow_overmatch x0.5, cruiser_he_damaging x0.25"
  - "mobility 10%: speed x1, rudder_shift x0.5, turning_circle x0.5"
  - "spotting 5%: concealment x1, radar_range x0.5, hydro_range x0.5, torpedo_detection x0.5, smoke_lifetime x0.25"
